// Ashtabula County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Board of Elections,
// Henderson Memorial and Rock Creek libraries) were checked in a browser.
//
// THE COUNTY MOVED DOMAINS
//
//   * ashtabulacounty.us now redirects to ashtabulacounty.gov; all page IDs
//     carry over. The county's own pages still link many .us addresses and the
//     dead courts.co.ashtabula.oh.us; the live courts site is
//     courts.ashtabulacounty.gov. The Auditor is auditor.ashtabulacounty.gov
//     (Tyler iasWorld Public Access); the parcel map is parcelmap.ashtabulacounty.us.
//   * Village of Jefferson and Saybrook Township moved to .gov domains.
//
// RENAMES AND CLOSURES
//
//   * Ashtabula County Medical Center is now Ashtabula Regional Medical Center
//     (armchealth.org). Community Counseling Center merged into Ravenwood
//     Health in February 2026.
//   * OhioMeansJobs Ashtabula County lives on acdjfs.org (its page slug is
//     literally "copy-of-transportation").
//   * conneautchamber.org is now a domain squatter; the Conneaut chamber has no
//     site. rockcreekareachamber.com is a parked page. The Victorian
//     Perambulator Museum in Jefferson closed in 2022.
//   * The Rock Creek Public Library and Henderson Memorial (Jefferson) block
//     automated fetches but load normally.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Conneaut Lake (PA), Andover (MA), Geneva (NY/IL), Jefferson County OH
//   (jeffersonswcd), Plymouth Township in Richland County, and an
//   "Assumption School Geneva" in Missouri all show up in searches.
//   genevaonthelake.org is the visitors bureau; the village is
//   genevaonthelakeoh.gov. Pymatuning State Park's reservoir straddles the
//   Pennsylvania line, and the PA side is a separate park.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Three cities (Ashtabula, Conneaut, Geneva), seven villages, 27 townships;
//     only eight townships have their own sites. Jefferson is the county seat.
//   * Three health districts: the county (Jefferson), the City of Ashtabula and
//     the City of Conneaut.
//   * Probate and Juvenile share one judge; Eastern County Court sits in
//     Jefferson and Western in Geneva.
//   * Cleveland TV market, no local station. Four Lilly Broadcasting stations
//     share 3226 Jefferson Road, Ashtabula; WKKY is licensed to Geneva.
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: the Recorder's cotthosting land-records
// search and court eServices (errors / blocked), the Soil & Water district, the
// Board of DD, Children Services and the Port Authority (no sites found),
// Reserve Care hospice (no Ashtabula office confirmed), Habitat for Humanity,
// Goodwill and the Dream Center (blocked or none), Torchlight (Lake County),
// Rabbit Run Theater (Madison, Lake County), and nineteen townships with no site.

